  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Unity4Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The proposed 36-months project will engage into three streaks of activities to improve the situation at the local level &#xbf; strengthening capacities of grass-root community-based organisations and local self-governance, providing &lt;em&gt;Locally-led Development and Recovery Grants &lt;/em&gt;to solve local problems in participatory way, &lt;em&gt;Platform, Networking and Community Development Grants &lt;/em&gt;to support umbrella organizations providing networking and educational opportunities&lt;em&gt;, &lt;/em&gt;and &lt;em&gt;Media Grants&lt;/em&gt; for media CSOs to cover the issues of recovery, European integration and locally-led development and raising awareness of the population on the impact of community-led development via success stories of local CSOs and initiative groups.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
